  "description": "An overview of positions we already picked up and current concerns with market structure. It's ok to test some positions...but NOT time to get aggressive",
  "body_html": "<p>As always, questions are welcome in the chat. In this video we talk about positions that are performing well, and a reminder as to WHY we are holding WNS. That full video is linked below. The biggest warning right now is that the <a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/c-113459534\">Stock Market has a Potential Bull Trap</a> formation. If we are in fact trending upwards, then more positions will start working, and we can add at that point. Right now its still a “test” stage. </p><p>It was a bit…refreshing…to see what we have been doing, treading lightly and approaching the markets cautiously, is the exact approach Mark Minervini has been doing. You can watch <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/live/nV7LpnTieoQ\">Mark Minervini’s Market Overview 07 May 2025</a> here. He also noted that this has been a “hard penny” environment. </p><p>I think it is fine to test some positions…I already have a few I am working with, but if you are looking for a few stocks to “test” out, below is today’s market screener results. Your’e welcome to ping me if you want to talk more about an individual name. </p>",
  "has_dynamic_content": false,
